# The 3D prior map is ~7 MB of binary that changes wholesale on every mapping
# run, so it is deliberately NOT tracked. Copy it to a new machine instead:
#   scp pcd/pepper_map_lc.pcd <host>:~/ros2_ws/src/pepper4dec/pepper_navigation/pcd/
# then colcon build, which installs it into the package share where the launch
# defaults look for it. *_poses.txt IS tracked: it is small.
*.pcd
